In CVRP, a fleet of vehicles with a maximum load capacity must visit a set of customers (each with a specific demand) starting and returning to a central depot[cite: 1, 2]. The goal is to minimize the total travel distance while satisfying all vehicle capacity constraints[cite: 2].

